==German==

===Etymology===
Equivalent to {{suffix|Durst|ig|lang=de}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈdʊʁstɪç/|[ˈdʊʁstɪç]|[ˈdʊɐ̯stɪç]|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|durs|tig|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|er|sten}}

# [[thirsty]]

====Usage notes====
* The normal German expression for “I’m thirsty” is ''ich habe Durst'' rather than ''ich bin durstig'', although the latter is also possible.

